|-------|-------|----------|
| `ModuleNotFoundError` on App Service | Missing dependency in `requirements.txt` | Add the module to `requirements.txt` and redeploy |
| `Application Error` on startup | Startup command wrong or port mismatch | Set `WEBSITES_PORT=8000` and startup command to `uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000` |
| ChromaDB `FileNotFoundError` | `chroma_db/` not included in deployment | Include it in your ZIP deployment package |
| Cosmos DB `ServerSelectionTimeoutError` | Connection string wrong or firewall blocking | Check App Settings for `MONGODB_URI`. Enable "Allow access from Azure services" in Cosmos DB Networking |
| CORS error in browser | Backend CORS not configured | Add frontend URL to `az webapp cors add` |
| Frontend shows blank page | `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` not set | Set it in Static Web App Configuration → Application settings |
| Quiz generation timeout | Ngrok tunnel is down | Restart your local model server and update the Ngrok URL |
| 502 Bad Gateway | App Service needs more memory | Scale up from B1 to B2, or check for memory leaks |

