## Step 9: Custom Domain Setup (when you purchase your domain)

### 9a. Frontend — Static Web Apps Custom Domain

```powershell
# Add custom domain to Static Web App
az staticwebapp hostname set \
  --name swa-sinhala-frontend \
  --hostname sinhalateacher.lk

# Also add www subdomain
az staticwebapp hostname set \
  --name swa-sinhala-frontend \
  --hostname www.sinhalateacher.lk
```

**DNS Records to add at your domain registrar:**

| Type | Name | Value |
|------|------|-------|
| CNAME | `www` | `swa-sinhala-frontend.azurestaticapps.net` |
| TXT | `@` | (validation token from Azure Portal) |
| A | `@` | (IP from Azure Portal) |

SSL certificate is **automatically provisioned** by Azure — no cost, no setup.

### 9b. Backend — App Service Custom Domain

```powershell
# Add custom domain for API
az webapp config hostname add \
  --webapp-name app-sinhala-backend \
  --resource-group rg-sinhala-avatar-prod \
  --hostname api.sinhalateacher.lk

# Create free managed SSL certificate
az webapp config ssl create \
  --name app-sinhala-backend \
  --resource-group rg-sinhala-avatar-prod \
  --hostname api.sinhalateacher.lk
```

**DNS Record:**

| Type | Name | Value |
|------|------|-------|
| CNAME | `api` | `app-sinhala-backend.azurewebsites.net` |

